BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (    # The Tale of the Twin Rivers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    In the ancient days, two rivers flowed through a barren valley-the River of First Trust and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      the River of Reciprocity. Each was governed by a spirit, and both spirits possessed magica) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      l waters.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (    The First Spirit held five golden vessels each dawn. She could pour any amount into the vall) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ey between them, and the waters would triple as they flowed toward the Second Spirit. But ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      the Second Spirit alone decided what waters to return upstream, defying nature itself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    For many seasons, fear ruled. The First Spirit hoarded her vessels, and the Second Spirit re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ceived nothing. The valley remained barren, and both spirits grew weaker.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    One day, the First Spirit poured generously, trusting in balance. The waters tripled and flo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      wed abundantly to the Second Spirit. Moved by this faith, the Second Spirit returned half ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      the blessing upstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (    Both spirits flourished. The more the First Spirit trusted, the more flowed between them. Th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      e more the Second Spirit honored this trust, the more both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    Soon the valley bloomed eternal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    The ancient lesson remains: **Abundance flows from trust given and trust honored. When we po) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ur forth generously and return faithfully, all rivers rise together.**) Tj ET
