BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      , moved by this faith, returned a worthy portion - not all, for they too needed sustenance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      , but enough to honor the gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    Solara's people drank deeply. The cycle continued.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (    The villages learned: when both give with open hands and return with grateful hearts, the sa) Tj ET
