BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      For many seasons, fear ruled. The First Spirit hoarded her vessels, and the Second Spirit ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        received nothing. The valley remained barren, and both spirits grew weaker.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
