BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      aps we both learn that cooperation remains possible despite our conflicting memories. If t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      hey take all six again, I learn something else-but risk less finding out.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
